' ==============================================================================
' 3-1-unideal-admin-UC.puml
'
' Svrha:    Pretplata i administracija: plaćanje pretplate partnera i poslovi administratora (UC-6.1, UC-6.2, UC-7.1 – UC-7.4).
' Autor:    Elide Babić
' AI:       Nacrt je izrađen uz pomoć alata Claude prema uputama autorice;
'           autorica ga je iscrtala, provjerila prema specifikacijama u 3.2 i
'           odgovara za sadržaj.
'
' Diagram level: System Requirements
' Diagram type:  Use Case Diagram
' ==============================================================================

@startuml
' Smjer veza (predavanja, slajd 24): aktivni akter -> obrazac, obrazac -> pasivni akter.
title UniDeal – pretplata i administracija (Slika 3.5)
left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #212529

skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
    BorderColor #212529
    BackgroundColor<<external system>> #FFF3CD
    BorderColor<<external system>> #856404
}

skinparam usecase {
    BackgroundColor #E7F1FF
    BorderColor #0D6EFD
}

actor "Partner" as Partner
actor "Administrator" as Admin

actor "Stripe" as Stripe <<external system>>
actor "Resend\n(e-mail)" as Mail <<external system>>

rectangle "Sustav UniDeal" {
    (UC-6.1\nPlaćanje pretplate) as UC61
    (UC-6.2\nAžuriranje stanja\npretplate) as UC62
    (UC-7.1\nOdobravanje partnera) as UC71
    (UC-7.2\nUpravljanje\nkorisničkim računima) as UC72
    (UC-7.3\nUpravljanje\nkategorijama ponuda) as UC73
    (UC-7.4\nPregled statistike\nplatforme) as UC74
}

Partner --> UC61
UC61 --> Stripe
' Stripe je aktivni akter UC-6.2: sam šalje obavijest o plaćanju.
Stripe --> UC62

Admin --> UC71
Admin --> UC72
Admin --> UC73
Admin --> UC74

UC71 --> Mail
@enduml
